WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.838
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.858 --> 01:34.378
[Episode 33]

01:34.519 --> 01:37.399
I remember she once told me

01:37.399 --> 01:40.279
that being an emperor is challenging.

01:40.399 --> 01:44.379
One has to be tough and resilient.

01:44.399 --> 01:45.559
So

01:46.159 --> 01:47.759
there are things

01:47.920 --> 01:49.759
you need to abandon.

01:50.119 --> 01:51.399
Including those

01:52.640 --> 01:54.880
you hold dear.

02:01.959 --> 02:04.499
I kept you in Danzhou for so many years.

02:04.519 --> 02:06.579
You suffered a lot,

02:06.599 --> 02:08.560
which you didn't have to.

02:10.439 --> 02:12.039
Please don't blame me.

02:16.119 --> 02:17.320
Your Majesty.

02:18.880 --> 02:19.960
I...

02:20.559 --> 02:21.720
Your Majesty,

02:24.839 --> 02:27.519
I'm confused about who my father is.

02:39.200 --> 02:40.680
Isn't that obvious?

02:56.760 --> 02:59.320
Even a fairy like her

02:59.880 --> 03:01.279
fell for a man

03:01.279 --> 03:04.199
and married into the imperial family
of the Southern Qing.

03:04.399 --> 03:05.680
Who did she marry?

03:06.239 --> 03:07.819
He was a lord.

03:07.839 --> 03:09.199
That is

03:09.600 --> 03:12.160
the current emperor of Southern Qing.

03:12.439 --> 03:14.479
She married Emperor Qing?

03:15.360 --> 03:16.479
Your Majesty,

03:16.839 --> 03:18.519
should I kneel?

03:18.719 --> 03:20.320
Do you feel like kneeling?

03:28.480 --> 03:29.840
If you don't,

03:30.320 --> 03:31.639
then don't kneel.

03:32.800 --> 03:36.300
Ye Qingmei was pregnant
with Emperor Qing's child.

03:36.320 --> 03:38.359
Emperor Qing's child?

03:38.760 --> 03:41.560
He is about the same age as you.

03:59.399 --> 04:00.600
Your Majesty...

04:05.119 --> 04:06.199
Father,

04:09.959 --> 04:13.120
I don't know when I was born.

04:13.160 --> 04:14.720
The 18th day of the first month.

04:15.119 --> 04:16.719
The 18th day of the first month?

04:17.040 --> 04:18.639
"Since you have come here."

04:18.759 --> 04:20.320
"Accept where you are at."

04:24.040 --> 04:25.519
Thank you, Your Majesty.

04:25.999 --> 04:27.839
I finally have a birth date.

04:29.759 --> 04:31.360
Concentrate on the mend.

04:31.679 --> 04:34.240
Go to Jiangnan once you recover.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.279
Take a look

04:36.759 --> 04:40.440
at what your mother left in this world.

05:19.520 --> 05:21.079
I'm pleased to meet you.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.759
Sadly,

05:25.720 --> 05:27.000
I'm late.

05:31.079 --> 05:32.560
We brushed past each other,

05:33.960 --> 05:35.040
Mother.

05:47.920 --> 05:50.040
Xian, I checked around.

05:50.079 --> 05:51.279
No one is outside.

05:56.119 --> 05:57.199
Xian.

05:58.319 --> 05:59.599
What's wrong with you?

06:01.840 --> 06:03.839
Today, His Majesty

06:04.239 --> 06:05.839
acknowledged me

06:07.280 --> 06:08.800
as his son for the first time.

06:11.720 --> 06:12.880
After all,

06:13.559 --> 06:15.000
blood is thicker than water.

06:17.280 --> 06:20.120
Every answer I said in front of him

06:20.999 --> 06:22.719
was so carefully crafted.

06:23.520 --> 06:25.240
I was as if I admired him like a father

06:25.639 --> 06:27.800
and I was sentimental about him.

06:29.879 --> 06:30.959
Xian.

06:33.079 --> 06:35.240
But that wasn't what I meant.

06:37.199 --> 06:38.320
Ruoruo,

06:39.319 --> 06:41.399
I was pretending.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.159
Why?

06:45.160 --> 06:46.759
Because I'm afraid.

06:48.639 --> 06:49.839
Afraid?

06:51.400 --> 06:53.360
Are you afraid
that His Majesty lies to you?

06:53.800 --> 06:55.159
Not exactly.

06:57.639 --> 06:59.279
I can sense

06:59.520 --> 07:01.360
that his emotions are genuine.

07:02.600 --> 07:03.559
But somehow,

07:03.559 --> 07:06.440
I sense a hidden side of him

07:07.679 --> 07:09.440
besides his emotions.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.399
What makes you think that way?

07:15.439 --> 07:16.920
If he truly cherishes me as a son,

07:16.920 --> 07:18.179
he could've said those

07:18.199 --> 07:20.240
when he first met me.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.800
However, he just stood by
and watched coldly

07:22.820 --> 07:24.659
when I encountered danger
in the Capital,

07:24.679 --> 07:26.020
when I traveled to Northern Qi,

07:26.040 --> 07:27.260
the spring exam,

07:27.280 --> 07:28.440
and my wedding

07:29.840 --> 07:31.360
until today.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.240
Perhaps...

07:35.400 --> 07:37.160
Perhaps His Majesty was moved

07:37.180 --> 07:39.250
when you protected him
in the Hanging Temple.

07:40.840 --> 07:42.680
Whether or not he loves me

07:42.879 --> 07:44.639
depends on my performance.

07:44.879 --> 07:46.639
Whether or not I'm his son

07:46.720 --> 07:48.440
depends on my capability.

07:50.759 --> 07:52.000
Ruoruo,

07:52.879 --> 07:54.500
you don't see His Majesty
as much as I do.

07:54.520 --> 07:55.940
But let me ask you this.

07:55.960 --> 07:57.120
Will our father

07:57.439 --> 07:58.759
do that?

08:00.199 --> 08:01.279
He won't.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.240
Xian,

08:05.040 --> 08:06.440
you are saying this

08:07.600 --> 08:09.800
as if His Majesty were weighing up
the pros and cons.

08:12.246 --> 08:13.880
Worst than that,

08:14.800 --> 08:16.839
I have no idea since when

08:17.119 --> 08:19.040
he has been evaluating me

08:19.239 --> 08:21.159
and how long it will continue.

08:21.360 --> 08:22.639
I'm also clueless

08:22.639 --> 08:24.419
between affections and values,

08:24.439 --> 08:26.279
which matters more to him.

08:26.559 --> 08:28.159
As for me,

08:29.360 --> 08:31.279
am I his son

08:33.199 --> 08:34.800
or a pawn?

08:40.920 --> 08:42.239
Of course,

08:43.160 --> 08:45.239
these might be delusions.

08:45.359 --> 08:46.800
I'm just overthinking.

08:47.760 --> 08:49.560
Women's distinct never wrongs.

08:51.000 --> 08:52.299
I'm a man.

08:52.319 --> 08:53.780
My instinct tells me

08:53.800 --> 08:55.479
your instinct is correct.

08:57.359 --> 08:58.439
Xian,

08:58.599 --> 09:00.500
if His Majesty is so scary,

09:00.520 --> 09:01.860
let's wait until you recover

09:01.880 --> 09:03.440
and return to Danzhou.

09:04.479 --> 09:05.680
Capital

09:06.319 --> 09:07.699
is a worrying place to stay.

09:07.719 --> 09:08.839
Ruoruo,

09:10.120 --> 09:11.640
I'm afraid

09:12.559 --> 09:15.119
I can't return to Danzhou
whenever I want to escape.

09:19.000 --> 09:20.800
I thought it through.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.359
I'm going to Jiangnan.

09:23.640 --> 09:24.980
It's not because of His Majesty's order

09:25.000 --> 09:26.760
or other reasons.

09:27.400 --> 09:29.640
Aside from simply

09:29.719 --> 09:31.280
muddling through my days

09:31.280 --> 09:32.959
with a wealthy and safe life,

09:34.400 --> 09:36.119
I realize there is something

09:37.199 --> 09:39.160
I need to do.

09:48.925 --> 09:52.220
[Fan's Residence]

09:53.359 --> 09:54.479
Wan'er.

09:57.079 --> 09:58.160
Wan'er.

10:00.520 --> 10:01.600
Wan'er.

10:15.640 --> 10:17.560
Are you Mr. Wuzhu?

10:23.330 --> 10:24.479
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan now.

10:24.479 --> 10:26.000
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

10:26.920 --> 10:28.450
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan now.

10:28.470 --> 10:30.070
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

10:30.640 --> 10:31.970
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan now.

10:31.990 --> 10:33.640
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.780
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan now.

10:35.800 --> 10:37.430
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

10:37.479 --> 10:38.940
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan now.

10:38.960 --> 10:40.600
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

10:56.640 --> 10:58.719
Yes, I'm Wuzhu.

11:07.679 --> 11:08.659
You are injured.

11:08.679 --> 11:09.759
Yes.

11:09.920 --> 11:11.459
Deducing from the current situation,

11:11.479 --> 11:13.299
I won't survive if I go to the palace.

11:13.319 --> 11:15.680
So you relay the message to Fan Xian.

11:15.839 --> 11:17.400
Who has been targeting you?

11:17.719 --> 11:18.800
A lot.

11:19.240 --> 11:20.479
The entire Capital

11:20.640 --> 11:21.839
is not safe.

11:22.800 --> 11:24.260
Was it you who killed my brother?

11:24.280 --> 11:25.360
It was me.

11:25.479 --> 11:26.699
I want to kill you.

11:26.719 --> 11:27.799
Yes, you can.

11:29.040 --> 11:30.020
I understand.

11:30.040 --> 11:30.980
I'm seriously injured.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.380
Based on the current situation,

11:32.400 --> 11:33.419
now is the best time

11:33.439 --> 11:34.740
for you to kill me.

11:34.760 --> 11:35.800
I must kill you.

11:35.800 --> 11:36.659
Yes, you can.

11:36.679 --> 11:37.370
I understand.

11:37.390 --> 11:38.780
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan.

11:38.800 --> 11:39.820
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan.

11:39.840 --> 11:40.870
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

11:40.880 --> 11:41.850
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

11:41.860 --> 11:42.959
Tell Fan Xian to go to Jiangnan now.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.059
Go to the Three Great Workshops.

11:44.079 --> 11:46.900
I will kill you, but not now!

11:46.920 --> 11:48.640
Go to the Three Great Workshops!

12:01.920 --> 12:02.819
Why?

12:02.839 --> 12:04.800
Because Fan Xian is heading to Jiangnan.

12:05.559 --> 12:07.999
But he lost all his inner energy.

12:08.760 --> 12:11.160
My mother and Cousin Chengze

12:11.240 --> 12:13.760
won't pass this up.

12:14.760 --> 12:17.479
I won't take your life for now

12:18.559 --> 12:20.199
because he needs you.

12:22.839 --> 12:24.560
You are indeed trustworthy.

12:25.760 --> 12:27.239
After the crisis,

12:27.800 --> 12:29.280
I won't let you

12:30.000 --> 12:31.839
off the hook.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.200
Deal.

12:33.760 --> 12:36.040
By the time Fan Xian
doesn't need me anymore,

12:36.199 --> 12:37.280
my life

12:37.719 --> 12:38.799
is yours.

12:57.640 --> 13:00.700
To think that the southward trip begins

13:01.040 --> 13:02.239
in the blink of an eye.

13:02.400 --> 13:04.020
Chengru, you might know about this.

13:04.040 --> 13:06.020
It has been ages since I went out.

13:06.040 --> 13:07.980
I have longed for fresh air out here.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.199
Exactly.

13:09.559 --> 13:11.400
Though I'm in the Capital now,

13:11.520 --> 13:13.579
I hanker the scenery at the border.

13:13.599 --> 13:14.780
To hear you say that,

13:14.800 --> 13:16.380
it seems that leaving the Capital

13:16.400 --> 13:17.780
is quite enticing.

13:17.800 --> 13:18.800
You are a little boy now.

13:18.820 --> 13:20.800
You will figure this out
when you are older.

13:22.479 --> 13:23.780
For this great landscape,

13:23.800 --> 13:25.320
how about we have a drink?

13:25.839 --> 13:26.919
Let's go.

13:33.760 --> 13:34.840
Come.

13:43.679 --> 13:45.440
Won't it be too grand

13:45.599 --> 13:47.400
for a farewell?

13:51.559 --> 13:53.119
We are close.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.999
You deserve this.

13:55.760 --> 13:57.260
Your Highness, I'm touched

13:57.280 --> 13:58.959
by your compassion.

13:59.679 --> 14:00.839
Fan Xian,

14:01.160 --> 14:02.860
His Highness treats you with respect.

14:02.880 --> 14:04.220
You mustn't forget

14:04.240 --> 14:06.239
that you are the subject.

14:08.000 --> 14:09.210
I'm flattered.

14:09.230 --> 14:10.260
Thank you, Your Highness

14:10.280 --> 14:12.359
and other princes.

14:14.400 --> 14:15.419
What are you doing?

14:15.439 --> 14:16.560
I can't accept

14:16.880 --> 14:17.740
your bow, Master.

14:17.760 --> 14:18.840
Behave.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.300
Since all of you are here,

14:26.320 --> 14:28.199
I would like to take this opportunity

14:29.319 --> 14:30.860
to share my troubles.

14:30.880 --> 14:32.040
Trouble?

14:33.280 --> 14:34.520
To be honest,

14:35.319 --> 14:36.959
as a son,

14:41.640 --> 14:43.239
I don't do a good job.

14:47.559 --> 14:49.119
As you know,

14:50.319 --> 14:51.839
I grew up in Danzhou

14:52.359 --> 14:54.479
and just got back here in recent years.

14:55.079 --> 14:56.819
I have been living
in the Fan's Residence

14:56.839 --> 14:58.980
but there is something deep inside

14:59.000 --> 15:00.199
I couldn't get over.

15:00.559 --> 15:01.999
It worries me a lot.

15:03.800 --> 15:04.999
What is that?

15:05.319 --> 15:06.599
Tell us.

15:07.120 --> 15:09.040
I can help you. What makes you worry?

15:12.850 --> 15:15.470
I have come back for some time, yet I'm not
registered under the Fan's ancestral hall.

15:15.479 --> 15:16.800
Isn't it appropriate?

15:17.520 --> 15:18.959
Surely, this worries me.

15:21.719 --> 15:23.719
As I'm leaving,
I have gained some courage.

15:23.880 --> 15:25.040
Father,

15:25.280 --> 15:26.459
I hope the princes here

15:26.479 --> 15:27.999
will bear witness for me.

15:28.199 --> 15:29.659
When I return from Jiangnan,

15:29.679 --> 15:33.599
I should kowtow and offer incense
in the ancestral hall.

15:34.719 --> 15:35.879
Think it over.

15:35.960 --> 15:37.900
Once you are registered
under the genealogy,

15:37.920 --> 15:40.199
you are part of the Fan family.

15:40.640 --> 15:42.040
Look what you said.

15:42.240 --> 15:44.150
I have been part of the Fan family
all along.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.740
Accomplish your mission first.

15:48.760 --> 15:49.879
As for the rest,

15:49.920 --> 15:51.700
we will talk about it when you are back.

15:56.880 --> 15:57.659
Don't worry.

15:57.679 --> 15:58.860
I will

15:58.880 --> 16:00.240
bear witness for you.

16:01.640 --> 16:02.999
Thank you, Your Highness.

16:03.160 --> 16:04.320
Well done.

16:04.439 --> 16:05.419
A smart move in disguise.

16:05.439 --> 16:07.560
He burns his own bridges
and gains a new prospect.

16:08.439 --> 16:10.339
Chengze, I don't quite understand.

16:10.359 --> 16:12.250
I'm saying this sincerely.
I'm impressed.

16:12.270 --> 16:13.670
I will give you a toast.

16:22.160 --> 16:23.520
Your qi is all gone.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.539
Mind how you go.

16:25.559 --> 16:26.819
Still, it's better

16:26.839 --> 16:28.560
than a spent force.

16:28.839 --> 16:30.079
Keep yourself alive.

16:30.599 --> 16:32.079
I will wait for you.

16:43.131 --> 16:44.320
Take down Jiangnan.

16:44.359 --> 16:45.680
Reclaim, to be precise.

16:46.080 --> 16:47.479
You do know your things.

16:57.990 --> 16:59.479
Take good care of Chengping.

17:00.199 --> 17:01.740
The Third Prince
isn't going back with you?

17:01.760 --> 17:03.320
Father wants him to go with you.

17:03.760 --> 17:04.899
As your disciple,

17:04.919 --> 17:06.740
I should serve by your side.

17:06.760 --> 17:07.740
Father allows me

17:07.760 --> 17:09.000
to travel with you.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.280
Go ahead.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.819
Send me a message if you are in trouble.

17:13.839 --> 17:15.550
I will come myself if necessary.

17:16.190 --> 17:17.780
You have to command the Imperial Guards.

17:17.800 --> 17:19.599
I might as well give up the position.

17:19.639 --> 17:21.159
I won't be executed anyway.

17:21.879 --> 17:23.139
Don't always try to escape.

17:23.159 --> 17:25.399
The Capital needs someone like you.

17:35.599 --> 17:37.119
Take care of His Majesty.

17:37.200 --> 17:38.280
Yes.

17:38.520 --> 17:40.200
This is my duty.

17:54.319 --> 17:55.339
It's windy up here.

17:55.359 --> 17:57.040
Father, you should go.

17:57.200 --> 18:00.020
The Ming family operates
the Three Great Workshops.

18:00.040 --> 18:01.339
They have deep and wide connections.

18:01.359 --> 18:03.119
It's their turf.

18:03.680 --> 18:06.079
It's good if you succeed.

18:06.079 --> 18:07.180
If otherwise,

18:07.200 --> 18:08.439
just come back home

18:08.599 --> 18:10.240
and give up everything.

18:10.280 --> 18:12.460
The Fan family will raise you.

18:12.480 --> 18:13.399
All right.

18:13.399 --> 18:15.000
Father, let me send you down.

18:20.919 --> 18:21.899
What's wrong, Father?

18:21.919 --> 18:23.520
Do you have any orders?

18:23.639 --> 18:25.919
This isn't my first time
going on a long journey.

18:27.520 --> 18:28.619
Um...

18:28.639 --> 18:29.719
Well,

18:29.800 --> 18:30.980
I will speak for him.

18:31.000 --> 18:31.980
Are you serious

18:32.000 --> 18:34.000
about the ancestral hall?

18:37.800 --> 18:38.879
Oh, dear. Fan.

18:38.879 --> 18:40.439
This is unbelievable.

18:40.680 --> 18:41.040
Well.

18:41.040 --> 18:42.850
I will kowtow to you now.

18:42.870 --> 18:44.359
- Don't do that!
- Don't do that!

18:44.839 --> 18:46.399
I can't afford that, Mr. Fan.

18:46.680 --> 18:48.319
I have got used to your casual behavior.

18:48.319 --> 18:49.819
It's awkward

18:49.839 --> 18:51.800
if you really kowtow.

18:51.960 --> 18:54.639
Just do it in your way.

18:55.159 --> 18:56.240
My way?

19:10.840 --> 19:12.439
My surname has always been Fan,

19:12.800 --> 19:14.159
and it always will be.

19:18.280 --> 19:19.599
I wait for you at home.

19:20.079 --> 19:21.439
Take care of yourself.

19:41.319 --> 19:43.139
One, two.

19:43.159 --> 19:45.079
One, two.

19:45.200 --> 19:47.119
One, two.

19:47.359 --> 19:49.200
One, two.

19:49.559 --> 19:50.639
One.

20:04.280 --> 20:06.560
Mr. Fan, the ship is departing soon.

20:07.240 --> 20:07.980
All right.

20:08.000 --> 20:09.080
Yes.

22:17.599 --> 22:18.960
I remember

22:19.200 --> 22:20.399
everything you said.

22:22.399 --> 22:24.240
The starry skies you gave me

22:25.159 --> 22:26.599
have always been there.

23:05.399 --> 23:06.800
Mr. Fan!

23:06.800 --> 23:09.099
Mr. Fan, you have just recovered.
Please remain seated.

23:09.119 --> 23:10.679
I will go check it out.

23:13.319 --> 23:15.480
Mr. Fan!

23:17.159 --> 23:19.000
Mr. Fan!

23:22.240 --> 23:26.940
Naval Grand Commandant of Shazhou,
Mr. Xu, presents you with some gifts.

23:26.960 --> 23:30.000
Please accept the gifts, Mr. Fan.

23:30.760 --> 23:32.159
What is this?

23:32.200 --> 23:33.599
It sounds
like they are delivering gifts.

23:33.599 --> 23:35.539
Naval Grand Commandant of Shazhou...

23:35.559 --> 23:37.020
You handle this.

23:37.040 --> 23:38.439
I will go and ask Mr. Fan.

23:38.559 --> 23:41.760
Please accept the gifts, Mr. Fan.

23:43.319 --> 23:47.819
Naval Grand Commandant of Shazhou,
Mr. Xu, presents you with some gifts.

23:47.839 --> 23:50.639
Please accept the gifts, Mr. Fan.

23:53.079 --> 23:54.399
Where are you from?

23:54.520 --> 23:56.819
I'm with Mr. Xu,
Naval Grand Commandant of Shazhou.

23:56.839 --> 23:58.980
Here are some gifts from Mr. Xu.

23:59.000 --> 24:01.599
Please accept the gifts.

24:02.240 --> 24:03.220
All right.

24:03.240 --> 24:04.180
Come.

24:04.200 --> 24:06.520
Pull the boxes up.

24:07.559 --> 24:09.240
Thank you, sir.

24:13.319 --> 24:14.399
Slowly.

24:17.159 --> 24:19.560
Naval Grand Commandant. Note it down.

24:22.559 --> 24:23.760
Be careful.

24:24.119 --> 24:25.720
Slowly.

24:29.760 --> 24:31.560
All right. Thank you so much.

24:31.800 --> 24:33.339
Thank you, sir.

24:33.359 --> 24:35.740
May Mr. Fan have a smooth journey.

24:35.760 --> 24:37.260
I shall take my leave.

24:37.280 --> 24:38.560
Goodbye.

24:42.079 --> 24:42.480
Let's go.

24:42.480 --> 24:44.260
Magistrate of Shazhou, Mr. Yao,

24:44.280 --> 24:46.320
presents you with some gifts.

24:46.359 --> 24:46.839
Another one.

24:46.839 --> 24:49.099
May Mr. Fan have a smooth journey

24:49.119 --> 24:50.420
and a bright future.

24:50.440 --> 24:51.299
All right.

24:51.319 --> 24:52.700
Pull them up.

24:52.720 --> 24:54.059
There are more coming.

24:54.079 --> 24:55.220
Get a book

24:55.240 --> 24:57.040
and record everything in detail.

24:57.200 --> 24:58.280
Yes.

24:59.159 --> 25:00.439
Be careful.

25:04.079 --> 25:06.439
Governor of Shazhou, Mr. Yao.

25:11.079 --> 25:12.359
Be careful.

25:13.639 --> 25:15.399
All right. Thank you.

25:15.440 --> 25:17.619
Goodbye.

25:17.639 --> 25:18.579
I shall take my leave.

25:18.599 --> 25:20.139
Take care.

25:20.159 --> 25:23.940
Mr. Li of the Vessels
and Transportation Office

25:23.960 --> 25:26.480
presents gifts to Mr. Fan.

25:26.599 --> 25:31.260
Mr. Sun, Officer of Supervision
of Shazhou, presents gifts to Mr. Fan.

25:31.280 --> 25:33.139
They are coming in a line.

25:33.159 --> 25:34.280
Someone,

25:34.440 --> 25:36.439
get me a chair.

25:40.800 --> 25:42.599
Where are you from?

25:51.159 --> 25:53.679
This box seems a bit small.

25:55.079 --> 25:57.639
We received so many gifts
when we just arrived in Shazhou.

25:58.960 --> 26:00.079
Your Highness,

26:00.559 --> 26:01.919
this shows

26:02.119 --> 26:03.819
that the Qing State

26:03.839 --> 26:06.460
is rich in resources

26:06.480 --> 26:08.139
and talents.

26:08.159 --> 26:09.439
I see.

26:12.040 --> 26:13.180
Wang.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.660
Why? Are there any words
you can't write?

26:14.680 --> 26:16.040
Well, no.

26:16.440 --> 26:19.359
It's not appropriate
to take gifts, right?

26:19.560 --> 26:22.020
Mr. Fan promotes the corruption
investigation in the Capital.

26:22.040 --> 26:23.899
But now, we are accepting gifts here.

26:23.919 --> 26:25.220
I'm afraid people will criticize.

26:25.240 --> 26:26.339
Don't worry.

26:26.359 --> 26:27.899
People on this ship are with us.

26:27.919 --> 26:29.260
Stay tight-lipped

26:29.280 --> 26:31.020
and not let the palace know about this.

26:31.760 --> 26:32.619
Your Highness,

26:32.639 --> 26:34.800
you shouldn't be saying this.

26:35.639 --> 26:36.760
Shi,

26:36.800 --> 26:39.200
you are new.

26:39.399 --> 26:41.200
But remember this.

26:41.359 --> 26:44.679
We follow every order Mr. Fan gives.

26:45.040 --> 26:48.200
Mr. Fan has never let anyone down.

26:49.080 --> 26:50.339
Don't miss out on any names.

26:50.359 --> 26:51.439
All right.

26:51.839 --> 26:52.919
Look over there.

27:02.399 --> 27:04.960
Master, look over there.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.720
Are they delivering gifts too?

27:10.000 --> 27:12.280
Judging from their clothes,
it doesn't look like it.

27:12.359 --> 27:13.800
They look like

27:14.079 --> 27:16.139
they are here to make complaints.

27:16.159 --> 27:17.280
That's possible.

27:17.359 --> 27:18.399
Mr. Fan, you are the imperial envoy.

27:18.399 --> 27:21.000
Blocking the road to make complaints
is quite common in plays.

27:21.240 --> 27:22.180
Mr. Fan,

27:22.200 --> 27:24.480
should we send the guards to stop them?

27:25.240 --> 27:26.780
I have been pondering on the way

27:26.800 --> 27:29.300
that what the Ming family would do

27:29.320 --> 27:31.100
to stop me from taking over
the Three Great Workshops.

27:31.119 --> 27:34.760
Are you saying
the Ming family is behind this?

27:37.280 --> 27:38.439
Let's observe first.

27:42.520 --> 27:43.600
Don't be afraid.

27:46.599 --> 27:48.480
Well, we are arriving soon.

27:56.325 --> 27:58.495
[Ming Qingda, head of the Ming family]

28:06.760 --> 28:08.359
Stay still.

28:23.200 --> 28:26.359
I heard that you two brought
the Eldest Princess' order here.

28:28.000 --> 28:29.560
What's it?

28:30.520 --> 28:31.960
Head of the Ming family,

28:32.559 --> 28:33.760
Ming Qingda.

28:34.599 --> 28:35.679
It's me.

28:36.480 --> 28:38.679
How may I address you?

28:38.919 --> 28:41.000
What were you doing up there?

28:47.240 --> 28:48.839
It was raining last night...

28:52.319 --> 28:53.879
It was raining last night.

28:55.079 --> 28:56.280
The sparrow

28:56.520 --> 28:58.119
fell from the beam.

28:59.159 --> 29:00.740
The baby bird can't fly yet.

29:00.760 --> 29:02.000
If

29:02.559 --> 29:04.079
I hadn't carried it up there,

29:05.720 --> 29:07.320
it would've died.

29:10.919 --> 29:12.159
A sparrow's nest.

29:18.150 --> 29:19.399
Please have a seat.

29:26.839 --> 29:28.110
Please have a seat.

29:32.879 --> 29:34.319
It was a rushed journey
by ship and horse.

29:34.319 --> 29:36.059
My buttocks are almost chafed.

29:36.079 --> 29:37.879
It hurts when I sit on hard surfaces.

29:40.319 --> 29:41.630
Please have some tea.

29:44.200 --> 29:45.280
Too much.

29:46.960 --> 29:48.240
What is too much?

29:49.639 --> 29:51.200
With the Ming family's wealth,

29:51.200 --> 29:54.700
the bird's nest and your tattered sleeve

29:54.720 --> 29:56.139
are too much of a pretense.

29:56.159 --> 29:57.320
It's intentional.

30:03.079 --> 30:04.359
I'm

30:04.599 --> 30:06.800
soft-hearted.

30:07.760 --> 30:09.280
Besides,

30:10.399 --> 30:11.919
I don't care about money.

30:11.960 --> 30:13.079
As the saying goes,

30:13.520 --> 30:14.819
"Despite great fortune,

30:14.839 --> 30:16.599
only a cup of plain tea

30:16.760 --> 30:18.079
offers me peace of mind."

30:19.200 --> 30:20.800
What a hypocrite.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.339
Talking as if you are less bothered.

30:22.359 --> 30:24.310
You are way better
than those in the Capital.

30:28.440 --> 30:29.960
I haven't asked you yet.

30:31.200 --> 30:32.800
How may I

30:32.960 --> 30:33.899
address you?

30:33.919 --> 30:35.040
Li Chengze.

30:38.280 --> 30:39.520
Second Prince?

30:47.839 --> 30:49.839
No need to kneel. Get up.

30:50.040 --> 30:51.280
I took sick leave to come to Jiangnan.

30:51.290 --> 30:52.960
Those in the Capital don't know.

30:53.680 --> 30:56.240
Stop wasting time.
I will cut right to the chase.

30:56.639 --> 30:57.850
Please, Your Highness.

30:57.870 --> 30:59.430
Fan Xian is coming down to Jiangnan.

30:59.450 --> 31:01.520
How does the Ming family plan
to deal with him?

31:08.639 --> 31:09.619
I don't know.

31:09.639 --> 31:10.839
Eat grapes?

31:14.119 --> 31:15.280
I don't know.

31:15.520 --> 31:16.800
Interesting.

31:17.520 --> 31:19.420
Aren't you the head of the Ming family?

31:19.440 --> 31:20.800
This is a serious matter.

31:24.559 --> 31:26.099
My mother will decide.

31:26.119 --> 31:27.679
Let's talk together, then.

31:28.440 --> 31:30.059
You have been listening.

31:30.079 --> 31:31.439
Come out!

31:54.839 --> 31:55.919
Mother.

32:12.440 --> 32:14.560
I'm a mere woman.

32:14.680 --> 32:16.679
Without your summon,

32:17.359 --> 32:19.560
I shouldn't show myself.

32:24.359 --> 32:26.579
You are the head of the Ming family.

32:26.599 --> 32:30.439
You should decide everything yourself.

32:31.720 --> 32:33.399
I feel anxious

32:33.839 --> 32:35.560
without your guidance, Mother.

32:35.960 --> 32:37.220
Oh, boy.

32:37.240 --> 32:38.879
You have all grown up.

32:38.960 --> 32:42.040
How long do you want an old woman
to take care of you?

32:42.720 --> 32:44.359
You will live a long life, Mother.

32:44.680 --> 32:46.000
Longer than mine.

32:47.000 --> 32:48.320
Oh, my.

32:54.079 --> 32:55.520
I will mend it for you.

33:05.680 --> 33:08.480
So frugality does run in the family.

33:09.119 --> 33:10.011
[Old Madam Ming]
You ask

33:10.012 --> 33:13.000
[mother of the head of the Ming family]
how we deal with Fan Xian.

33:14.359 --> 33:16.119
It's simple, actually.

33:16.559 --> 33:19.119
The Ming family has been serving
the Eldest Princess

33:19.440 --> 33:21.359
and you, Your Highness.

33:21.680 --> 33:24.200
We do

33:24.359 --> 33:25.940
what you want us to do.

33:25.960 --> 33:28.960
I want the Ming family
to keep the Three Great Workshops.

33:31.520 --> 33:32.639
All right.

33:35.079 --> 33:36.940
It's done?

33:36.960 --> 33:38.560
The Ming family will do

33:38.839 --> 33:40.399
as you say.

33:47.639 --> 33:49.240
It's just

33:50.119 --> 33:51.960
that there is a problem.

33:53.559 --> 33:54.839
Let's hear it.

33:55.119 --> 33:58.630
Mr. Fan's takeover of the Imperial Treasury

33:58.839 --> 34:00.919
is His Majesty's decree.

34:01.319 --> 34:04.139
The Ming family are merely commoners.

34:04.159 --> 34:05.800
How could we defy the decree?

34:06.919 --> 34:08.919
It's difficult, Your Highness.

34:10.999 --> 34:12.680
I thought so too.

34:13.190 --> 34:15.379
Regardless of how worthy
the Three Great Workshops are,

34:15.399 --> 34:18.260
it's not necessary
to risk your lives for it.

34:18.280 --> 34:22.379
Besides, you could always
join Fan Xian's side.

34:22.399 --> 34:25.200
Whichever side you take,
you are still lackeys, right?

34:34.159 --> 34:35.280
Am I

34:35.879 --> 34:38.359
being vulgar?

34:41.039 --> 34:42.200
Your Highness,

34:42.519 --> 34:45.720
the Ming family doesn't intend
to switch sides.

34:46.359 --> 34:48.660
We only hope you can show us a good way.

34:48.680 --> 34:50.740
There is no good way
since you defy the decree.

34:50.760 --> 34:52.730
If there is any, I would've used it.

34:52.750 --> 34:53.359
Your Highness.

34:53.359 --> 34:54.459
I was just saying.

34:54.479 --> 34:55.540
Well,

34:55.560 --> 34:57.200
there are no good ways.

34:57.200 --> 34:59.299
Fortunately,

34:59.319 --> 35:00.839
I have cut off your backup.

35:02.720 --> 35:03.740
Deng Ming'en

35:03.760 --> 35:04.939
has three sons.

35:04.959 --> 35:06.359
Collect your reward.

35:06.640 --> 35:08.899
The Ming family distributes bounty

35:08.919 --> 35:11.080
to recruit help from everywhere.

35:11.200 --> 35:13.959
Whoever registers
can collect the reward.

35:13.959 --> 35:15.620
...has two sons.

35:15.640 --> 35:18.160
The Ming family distributes bounty

35:18.359 --> 35:20.600
to recruit help from everywhere.

35:20.879 --> 35:24.200
Whoever registers
can collect the reward.

35:24.999 --> 35:26.800
Collect the reward.

35:31.680 --> 35:32.620
Mr. Zhang

35:32.640 --> 35:34.540
has a daughter and a grandson.

35:34.560 --> 35:36.080
Collect your reward.

35:37.959 --> 35:38.879
Zhang Zizhi.

35:38.879 --> 35:40.120
Father.

35:40.399 --> 35:43.519
I will take care of them. Don't worry.

35:47.359 --> 35:48.760
Wang Furen

35:48.839 --> 35:51.019
has a daughter and a son

35:51.039 --> 35:52.600
in a young age.

35:52.640 --> 35:54.359
Collect your reward.

36:12.399 --> 36:14.559
Please accept the gifts, Mr. Fan.

36:14.640 --> 36:16.240
I shall take my leave.

36:18.479 --> 36:20.100
Misters,

36:20.120 --> 36:21.919
what are you doing?

36:22.560 --> 36:24.310
Excuse me. May I ask

36:24.330 --> 36:25.660
what are you doing down there?

36:25.680 --> 36:27.120
Can't you see?

36:27.439 --> 36:28.870
We are robbing the ship.

36:28.890 --> 36:30.140
I see, robbing the ship...

36:30.160 --> 36:31.359
Robbing the ship?

36:32.640 --> 36:34.660
Why don't you come up here?

36:34.680 --> 36:36.200
We can't.

36:36.600 --> 36:37.959
It's too high.

36:40.399 --> 36:41.220
Come.

36:41.240 --> 36:43.160
Get them a ladder.

36:43.879 --> 36:45.819
That's right. Get us a ladder.

36:45.839 --> 36:47.600
Bring a ladder.

36:54.959 --> 36:56.140
Grab the ladder.

36:56.160 --> 36:57.359
Hold on tight.

36:57.680 --> 36:58.839
Be careful.

37:00.120 --> 37:01.959
The Ming family put out a bounty

37:02.519 --> 37:03.939
on Fan Xian?

37:03.959 --> 37:05.299
I heard

37:05.319 --> 37:07.999
the underbelly and officials
are under the Ming family's control.

37:08.200 --> 37:09.859
When the bounty is out,

37:09.879 --> 37:11.859
many flood in.

37:11.879 --> 37:13.039
I wish

37:14.399 --> 37:15.919
I could see that.

37:16.280 --> 37:18.100
The Ming family
has never put out a bounty.

37:18.120 --> 37:19.680
I did that on your behalf.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.160
From now on,

37:21.399 --> 37:25.700
the Ming family and Fan Xian
are archenemies.

37:25.720 --> 37:27.320
How could you cut off our backup?

37:33.839 --> 37:35.720
What time is it?

37:39.640 --> 37:40.999
It's gone the Wu hour.

37:43.280 --> 37:46.640
No wonder I feel dizzy.

37:47.479 --> 37:49.160
Please understand, Your Highness.

37:49.319 --> 37:51.439
I'm feeling tired.

37:51.760 --> 37:53.720
I need to take a nap

37:54.399 --> 37:56.320
when around this hour.

38:10.359 --> 38:11.680
Go ahead and rest.

38:17.800 --> 38:19.399
Actually, this is one more way.

38:21.680 --> 38:23.519
You can hire hitmen

38:23.519 --> 38:24.700
to surround me and kill me.

38:24.720 --> 38:26.519
Take my head to Fan Xian,

38:26.519 --> 38:28.839
and you can resolve
the grudge between you two.

38:39.120 --> 38:40.479
I was kidding.

38:40.879 --> 38:42.240
Don't take it too seriously.

38:43.479 --> 38:44.800
Go and rest.

38:55.760 --> 38:58.720
What a lovely family.

38:59.319 --> 39:00.720
This scene

39:02.200 --> 39:04.160
almost makes me cry.

39:06.240 --> 39:07.220
Take a rest.

39:07.240 --> 39:10.299
The Ming family put out this bounty.

39:10.319 --> 39:11.399
Yes.

39:11.720 --> 39:16.399
Whoever damages and robs the ship
can get the reward.

39:16.519 --> 39:19.660
In that case, aren't you pirates?

39:19.680 --> 39:21.359
We are not pirates.

39:21.760 --> 39:23.519
The pirates wouldn't come.

39:24.280 --> 39:26.090
After all, this is an official ship.

39:26.110 --> 39:27.559
They can't risk their lives

39:27.680 --> 39:29.879
for money, right?

39:29.959 --> 39:31.080
Wait. So you...

39:31.280 --> 39:32.760
You do know this is an official ship.

39:32.760 --> 39:34.640
How about your own lives?

39:35.160 --> 39:37.260
We have no choice.

39:37.280 --> 39:38.439
Why?

39:38.999 --> 39:41.060
There was a disaster in Jiangbei.

39:41.080 --> 39:43.260
We take our families

39:43.280 --> 39:47.240
and fled to Jiangnan. We are refugees.

39:47.760 --> 39:49.479
Without the Ming family,

39:49.919 --> 39:52.160
we would've starved to death.

39:52.999 --> 39:55.819
You say you are refugees from Jiangbei.

39:55.839 --> 39:56.919
Yes, we are.

39:57.039 --> 39:59.640
The relief fund for Jiangbei
has already been allocated.

39:59.640 --> 40:00.819
You can go home now.

40:00.839 --> 40:02.039
Sir,

40:02.399 --> 40:04.399
we would want to go back.

40:04.800 --> 40:06.680
We are also afraid of dying

40:07.120 --> 40:08.720
from hunger halfway.

40:09.319 --> 40:12.399
In that case,
the Ming family is helping you.

40:12.879 --> 40:14.039
Exactly.

40:16.800 --> 40:19.160
So they are doing good deeds.

40:19.999 --> 40:21.499
I think so.

40:21.519 --> 40:25.060
Anyway, all refugees work for them.

40:25.080 --> 40:26.280
We open up wasteland

40:26.399 --> 40:27.299
and repair roads.

40:27.319 --> 40:28.899
We do everything no one else would do.

40:28.919 --> 40:31.519
Day and night without rest.

40:31.600 --> 40:33.080
They don't pay us,

40:33.720 --> 40:35.439
they feed us food.

40:37.919 --> 40:39.140
How does the yamen react to this?

40:39.160 --> 40:42.660
They gave the Ming family a big plaque.

40:42.680 --> 40:44.120
It writes,

40:44.760 --> 40:46.919
"Good fortune rewards the benevolent."

41:02.080 --> 41:03.280
Chief Xia,

41:03.359 --> 41:04.540
all the refugees boarded.

41:04.560 --> 41:06.760
Shall we attack the ship now?

41:07.839 --> 41:09.620
If we really attack the ship now,

41:09.640 --> 41:12.439
those refugees would die.

41:16.230 --> 41:17.540
They have already damaged the ship.

41:17.560 --> 41:19.439
They are doomed, for sure.

41:20.280 --> 41:21.299
Let's observe

41:21.319 --> 41:22.879
how Fan Xian will do.

41:23.439 --> 41:24.700
Be patient, everyone.

41:24.720 --> 41:26.019
When he arrives in Jiangnan,

41:26.039 --> 41:28.039
we will have more time than we do now.

41:33.120 --> 41:34.339
Li Chengze

41:34.359 --> 41:36.439
is driving us to our death.

41:37.919 --> 41:39.760
Is that what you have to say?

41:41.720 --> 41:42.800
There is mole

41:43.560 --> 41:45.479
secretly helping Li Chengze.

41:45.640 --> 41:46.720
Otherwise,

41:47.080 --> 41:48.959
the bounty wouldn't work.

41:50.080 --> 41:51.600
Who is the head of the family?

41:53.080 --> 41:54.160
It's me.

41:55.160 --> 41:56.210
I'm responsible

41:56.230 --> 41:58.080
for the mistake happened in the clan.

41:59.399 --> 42:00.720
I should be punished.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

